WEBVTT

00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:08.810
As I said yesterday, a group of customers will
be coming today, so be sure to work diligently.

00:00:09.910 --> 00:00:13.660
Does this mean our sales will be fine this month?

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:17.160
We won't need to make our coffee cost 10,000 yen a cup.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:20.220
Welcom-

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:22.910
Kids?!

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:31.840
This place isn't a nursery...

00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:33.250
Hey, hey.

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:37.090
Give me some booze instead if you want to get me tipsy, kid.

00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:38.940
It's starting!

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:42.060
Ooh, who should I pick?

00:02:28.570 --> 00:02:29.870
Slow!

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:32.200
Nii-san still hasn't woken up yet?!

00:02:32.570 --> 00:02:36.530
At this rate, I'll be late for school too!

00:02:36.530 --> 00:02:37.830
Akiha-sama.

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:42.690
It's not every day that you get to go to school together,

00:02:42.690 --> 00:02:46.490
so how about waiting for just five more minutes?

00:02:47.110 --> 00:02:48.560
Just five more minutes!

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:51.310
While you're waiting, please have another cup of tea.

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:53.070
Thank you.

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:57.070
It tastes kind of weird.

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:59.720
I made it using some herbs from the garden.

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:01.070
I'm confident about it!

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:05.830
I overslept! I overslept!

00:03:06.280 --> 00:03:07.520
Sorry, Kohaku-san!

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:10.410
Did Akiha already... leave?

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:13.880
Huh? She waited...

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:15.630
And she isn't angry.

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:17.520
Um, Akiha...

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:21.720
I'm sorry. I know there's no way we'll be on time now, but...

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:26.680
Squeeze!

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:27.810
Huh?

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:30.560
You look way too suspicious!

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:32.060
What did you do, Kohaku-san?!

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:34.830
Big success!

00:03:34.830 --> 00:03:42.490
Truth be told, I had enough of Akiha-sama's usual
untruthful attitude, so I added a little something to her tea.

00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:44.910
It's a drug that makes people a little more honest.

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:49.290
Her true desires normally suppressed by
her conscious mind can now be released!

00:03:49.590 --> 00:03:53.100
And that's why Akiha-sama is so sweet and cute now!

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:54.250
Now, Shiki-san!

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:56.890
It'll be a dazzling dream world all day today!

00:03:56.890 --> 00:03:58.420
A paradise!

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:00.820
I-Is this true, Akiha?

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:03.800
Huh? Uh...

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:06.550
A-Akiha-san?

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:08.060
This is...

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:10.320
Step aside for a bit, Shiki-san.

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:13.020
Akiha-chan, how old are you?

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:13.810
Four.

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:15.230
Oh, this is bad.

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:17.120
Looks like she reverted back to being a child.

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:20.070
Was the drug too effective?

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:21.220
What should we do about this?!

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:23.400
I have to go to school right now, too!

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:26.910
Well, I'm pretty sure she'll return to normal in a day.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:29.160
Wow, I'm gonna be late.

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:30.450
I'll leave this to you!

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:32.910
Wait! How mean of you to just run away!

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:38.790
Don't leave me.

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:42.330
This is dangerous, Shiki-san.

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:44.320
Yeah, this is seriously dangerous.

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:47.890
Seriously dangerous! Our Akiha's seriously dangerous!

00:04:51.550 --> 00:04:53.420
Whoa, it's Akiha-sama!

00:04:53.420 --> 00:04:55.610
It's the mademoiselle transfer student, Akiha-sama!

00:04:55.610 --> 00:04:58.360
But what's Akiha-sama doing in our class?

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:02.360
It might not seem like it, but Akiha's
emotions are pretty unstable right now.

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:06.120
She reverts to a childlike state once in a while.

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:10.390
This is all because I never took proper care of Akiha all these years...

00:05:10.930 --> 00:05:12.620
Such grave circumstances?!

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:13.870
That's really bad.

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:15.340
Akiha-chan, how old are you?

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:17.050
Akiha-chan, I'll give you sweets.

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:19.000
Akiha-tan, you're way too cute!

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:22.250
Wh-What's with all this ruckus?!

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:24.750
What's a first-year doing in a second-year classroom?

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:26.470
Hey you, get back to your classroom!

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:28.590
Teacher, Akiha-chan's a second-year!

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:30.900
That's right! She's a four-year-old highschool second-year!

00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:33.690
Th-These young men are out of control!

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:38.070
You know, Akiha.

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:41.020
I can't go in unless you let go of me.

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:44.580
Just go in already, Tohno!

00:05:44.580 --> 00:05:47.830
Savor the embarrassment of taking a piss with your teenage sister watching!

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:49.230
You bastards...!

00:05:50.050 --> 00:05:52.580
She's totally watching...

00:05:56.220 --> 00:05:57.330
Pee pee.

00:05:57.590 --> 00:05:59.020
You too?

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:01.120
I'll wait, so go and do it.

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:02.480
I want to go with you.

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:03.800
What?!

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:10.080
Whoa, there's a crowd of people around Tohno-kun's sister.

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:11.600
It must be because she's beautiful.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:12.880
Perfect timing!

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:13.700
Girl over there!

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:15.060
Me?!

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:17.400
He called me "girl over there", he called me...!

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:20.080
Excuse me, but could you please accompany my sister?

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:22.450
And I'm supposed to escort Tohno-kun's sister?!

00:06:22.450 --> 00:06:24.300
She's afraid of going to the bathroom, so...

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:26.990
Ahh, I don't know what's going on anymore...

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:29.680
Ah, want to go to the bathroom with me?

00:06:29.680 --> 00:06:31.250
You must be Tohno-kun's sister.

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:32.620
I'm going with Nii-san.

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:34.910
Don't do that...

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:38.980
It might be better if you went in too, Tohno-kun...

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:40.550
You sure?

00:06:40.550 --> 00:06:41.750
There's no other way.

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:43.750
Come on, Akiha.

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:46.010
No, I'm scared!

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:48.030
I want to go in with you!

00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:48.880
No way.

00:06:49.990 --> 00:06:51.510
In that case...

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:52.680
Yumizuka-san.

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:55.260
Could you go in with her?

00:06:58.460 --> 00:07:01.800
I-I'll look away, so let me know when you're done.

00:07:01.800 --> 00:07:03.120
I don't know how.

00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:04.230
Help me.

00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:10.600
Uhh, I'll make sure not too look.

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:15.700
Wipe me.

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:17.050
W-W-Wipe?

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:22.330
I'll forget everything that happened today! I will!

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:28.250
T-Tohno-kun.

00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:31.360
I don't think I'll ever forget what happened today.

00:07:31.360 --> 00:07:33.610
Wait, what? Didn't you just say you'd forget it?

00:07:33.610 --> 00:07:36.200
P-Please help me out when I'm in a fix next time!

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:38.270
You mean you're not in a fix right now?

00:07:39.420 --> 00:07:42.510
Akiha, you really...

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:49.580
Hey, Akiha. It's time to go home.

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:53.210
You sleepy?

00:07:53.210 --> 00:07:54.370
In that case...

00:07:56.280 --> 00:08:02.500
Akiha-sama, as red as sunset.

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:09.840
When did I last see it while on my nanny's back?

00:08:10.610 --> 00:08:14.390
How many years has it been since I piggybacked you like this?

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:19.100
You were small and a crybaby, always following behind me...

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:20.230
Me?

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:23.600
But you grew up before I knew it...

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:25.560
And became so pretty.

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:28.770
What's more, you've become a far steadier person than me.

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:32.800
I'm glad I left the Arima family.

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:35.880
I'm really glad that I came back.

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:38.010
Nii-san...

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:41.910
Though, there's one part of you that hasn't grown at all.

00:08:50.930 --> 00:08:52.420
Welcome home, Shiki-chan.

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:55.260
It's like there's two of me now.

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:56.680
Don't make her drink it too!

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:01.430
Now now, come back twenty years later.

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:04.440
You're so cute! So cute!

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:08.090
If I was still living with my kid, he'd be just about your age!

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:11.440
Th-The next section's coming up.

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:16.990
Brainwash Detective Hisui.

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:19.530
An impossible string of murders at Village Mooncat.

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:21.620
The tragic love hidden in the shrine maiden's dance?!

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:25.330
A string of murders at a lonely village of 200 inhabitants!

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:28.710
What's with the mysterious dying message, "True Ancestors really are the strongest"?!

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:31.750
The shocking relationships linking the victims.

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:33.640
Who is the shrine maiden of the Cat Ears festival?

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:35.800
And the truth is finally revealed.

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:38.360
Village Mooncat is a UFO launching base?!

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:39.990
Scary! UFOs are so scary!

00:09:39.990 --> 00:09:43.390
Hisui-chan, please fulfill the wishes of this cursed village!

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:46.750
I'm thinking of entering a contest with this story. Well?

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:48.130
It won't work.

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:52.180
Brainwash Detective Hisui.

00:09:52.180 --> 00:09:54.370
A concrete jungle murder case?

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:56.360
Eh? Steel frames are attacking people?!

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:59.950
The tragic steel frame incident has shaken the city!

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:02.790
Its streets stained with blood, the city has become hell!

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:04.350
This is no coincidence.

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:07.040
It's a carefully planned criminal act!

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.170
Why? For what end?!

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:13.460
A man in blue full-body tights knows the truth, but he was murdered so he wouldn't talk!

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:16.720
What will the first witness, a beautiful young girl, say?!

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:22.210
And the first witness herself, me, is on the phone with you live at the scene! Well?

00:10:22.210 --> 00:10:23.390
Go give yourself up.

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:27.750
Brainwash Detective Hisui.

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:29.640
A large explosion on a super luxury cruise ship.

00:10:29.640 --> 00:10:31.110
A tragedy of 300?!

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:35.740
A string of murders occurs on a super luxury cruise ship carrying 300 wealthy passengers!

00:10:35.740 --> 00:10:37.320
One of the passengers is the culprit.

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:40.280
The passengers, consumed by suspicion, begin a witch hunt?!

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:42.780
It's become hell on board!

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:45.580
What's with the note from the criminal that says, "Are you serious? A truce"?

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:48.120
And a frightening truth is revealed!

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:50.750
The 300 wealthy people are actually brothers and sisters!

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:52.030
Scary! Siblings are so scary!

00:10:52.030 --> 00:10:53.290
The disappearing firstborn son.

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:54.400
The exploding secondborn son.

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:57.130
And the home-going 148th-born son!

00:10:57.130 --> 00:11:00.210
One mystery following the other, the stage once again shifts to Atlantis!

00:11:00.210 --> 00:11:03.430
The mystery of the hidden treasure will now be revealed!

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:04.860
Like that! Well?

00:11:04.860 --> 00:11:05.550
Pretty good.

00:11:05.550 --> 00:11:06.270
Really?!

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:16.160
Grail-kun!

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:17.810
What's wrong, Shirou-kun?

00:11:17.810 --> 00:11:23.080
Archer says I'll never become a hero!

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:26.200
You're so hopeless, Shirou-kun.

00:11:26.780 --> 00:11:31.290
Hero Creation Kit!

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:35.590
You'll be a hero after killing a million people.

00:13:09.060 --> 00:13:10.850
This is the real thing.

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:13.310
Next episode preview!

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:16.910
It's open to the youngsters.

00:13:16.910 --> 00:13:20.720
I want to know the Catchy Hiphop Rankings!

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:22.150
I don't.

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:24.480
Lyricist and composer, Fujimura Taiga.

00:13:24.480 --> 00:13:27.470
"Wh-Wh-Wh-Why, oh why?" is now No. 1 in the rankings!

00:13:27.470 --> 00:13:28.800
Thank you, check it out!

00:13:28.800 --> 00:13:30.910
Where in the universe is this happening?

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:33.970
Looks like linking it to the anime went well.

00:13:33.970 --> 00:13:36.470
What did you link it with?

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:41.010
Next episode: Final Dead Lancer.

00:13:41.010 --> 00:13:42.090
Look forward to it!

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:43.850
Now on sale!
